From 8b4353bf798ac52589a2e2a0e3e8cf9c0947ad6c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kumar Ankit <186563577+krank-09@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:28:14 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] feat: visual summary and HTML/PDF export for audit
 explanations

The explanation dialog now shows an 'At a glance' section drawn from the signed record's facts (not the model's text): outcome banner, network diagram with link states and per-route results, evidence-strength meter with odds in words, test-token bars against the alarm line, and each verifier's check against its limit. Download HTML saves a self-contained page (no scripts, no external assets); Save as PDF prints the same page via the browser's dialog. The API now returns the facts with each explanation; verifier checks are keyed by name (direct) or 'name (forwarded)'.
